n media 2 in modal\nOpen media 3 in modal\nOpen media 4 in modal\nOpen media 5 in modal\nOpen media 6 in modal\nOpen media 7 in modal\nOpen media 8 in modal\nOpen media 9 in modal\nOpen media 10 in modal\nOpen media 11 in modal\nOpen media 12 in modal\nOpen media 13 in modal\nOpen media 14 in modal\n1\n/\nof\n14\nToughpower SFX 450W Gold\nToughpower SFX 450W Gold\nSKU:PS-STP-0450FPCGUS-G\nToughpower Series STP-0450F-G – 450W 80 PLUS® Gold Certified Fully Modular APFC PSU\nView full details\nDesign\nSpecification\nDownload\nHow-to Videos\nThermaltake Toughpower SFX 450W Gold Incorporating various high-quality components, Toughpower SFX 450W Gold saves energy through its 80 PLUS Gold certified high efficiency of up to 90% and accommodates any mainstream build. The included matte black SFX to ATX adapter bracket enables users to easily install SFX Power supply into ATX chassis. Additionally, an embedded temperature controlled Zero RPM Smart Fan System is optimized to deliver excellent airflow at an exceptionally low noise level. Fully modular flat cable design is convenient for cable management. Moreover, the powerful single +12V rail enables non-stop usage with stable and reliable performance. 80 PLUS Gold Certified and Kaby Lake Ready Deliver up to 90% efficiency under real world load conditions to promise lowest power losses. Additionally, Toughpower SFX 450W Gold has been optimized to work with Intel’s new 6th-generation Kaby Lake processors to achieve maximum energy savings.Universal Compact Design for All Mainstream PC Cases – SFX to ATX PSU Adapter Bracket Toughpower SFX 450W Gold is designed with two-way application by the compatibility of both the latest Intel SFX 12V 3.3 and ATX 12V 2.4 standard. Toughpowr SFX Series has included a matte black SFX to ATX adapter bracket which helps users easily install an SFX power supply into an ATX, Micro-ATX or Mini-ITX chassis. In addition, with the compact design, Toughpower SFX Series allows better airflow inside the chassis as well as leaves more space for users to utilize. Zero RPM Smart Fan To maximally reduce undesired noise, Toughpower SFX 450W Gold is designed with an 80mm temperature controlled Zero RPM Smart Fan. The fan will not operate when the PSU is at low working loads. Fully Modular Low-Profile Flat Cables Fully modular Toughpower SFX 450W Gold offers cable selection for users while powering the system at an advantageous voltage. Low-profile flat black cables can make cable management easier, reduce clutter and increase airflow inside the chassis. 100% High Quality Japanese Capacitors Toughpower SFX 450W Gold features 100% high quality Japanese brand capacitors, which greatly improves the durability and offers the highest stability and reliability.Massive and Dedicated +12V Output Toughpower SFX 450W Gold is equipped with a powerful single +12V rail, please see the output specification below:AC INPUTInput Voltage: 100V-240V Input Current: 3.5A-7A Frequency: 50Hz-60HzDC OUTPUT+3.3V+5V+12V-12V+5VsbMax Output Current19A14A37A0.3A2.5AMax Output Power90W444W3.6W12.5WContinuous Power450W\nProduct Specifications\nP/N\nPS-STP-0450FPCGUS-G\nModel\nSTP-450AH1FEG\nType\nIntel SFX 12V 3.3 and ATX 12V 2.4\nForm Factor\nSFX\nMax Output Capacity\n450W\nPeak Output Capacity\n540W\nColor\nBlack\nPFC (Power Factor Correction)\nActive PFC\nPower Good Signal\n100-500 msec\nHold Up Time\n> 16msec at 75% of full load\nInput Current\n3.5A – 7A\nInput Frequency Range\n50Hz - 60Hz\nInput Voltage\n100V - 240V\nOperating Temperture\n0 ℃ to +40℃\nOperating Humidity\n20% to 85%,non-condensing\nStorage Temperture\n-20 ℃ to +90 ℃\nStorage Humidity\n5% to 95%, non-condensing\nCooling System\n8cm fan\nEfficiency\nMEET 80 PLUS®Gold at 115Vac input.\nMTBF\n120,000 hrs minimum\nSafety Approval\nCE/FCC/UL/Bauart Mark+CB/EAC\nPCI-E 6+2PIN\n2\nProtection\nOCP, OVP, OPP, SCP\nUser Manual\nFile Name\nDescription\nSize\nVersion\nRelease Date\nManual\nMulti-language\n2016-05-25\nConnect PCIe Cables to High Power Consumption GPU\n2022-07-18\n電源ユニットとグラフィックボードの接続方法について\n2022-07-18\n如何正確連接PCIe線材到高功率顯示卡\n2022-07-18\nDrivers & Software\nFile Name\nDescription\nSize\nVersion\nRelease Date\nContact Us\nGeneral Information\nSales Partner Request\nLAN Party Request\nMedia Contact\nSupport\nWarranty Policy\nHow to find S/N\neRMA Service\nTechnical Support\nSoftware Downloads\nCommunity\nJoin TT Mod\nCaseMOD Invitation\nForums\nMarketing Materials\nCompany\nAbout Us\nWhere to Buy\nPrivacy Policy\nPress Release\nCollaboration\nThe Tower 300 Wilier Edition\nTT x Wilier\nTR100 Koralie Edition\nLCGS Store\nFlagship Store\nSystem Lecture\nSystem Workshop\nVideos\nTT Camp\nLocation\nGlobal\nAustralia\nBrazil\nChina\nGermany\nJapan\nKorea\nLatam\nPoland\nRussia\nSpain\nTaiwan\nThailand\nTurkey\nUK\nUSA\nSubscribe to our emails\nEmail\nFacebook\nInstagram\nYouTube\nTwitter\nTwitch\nReddit\nCopyright © 2026 Thermaltake Technology Co., Ltd. All Rights Reserved.\nChoosing a selection results in a full page refresh.\nOpens in a new window.",
